# 中文说明：用户选择先完成可编译版本，以下缺失项明确不集成。
# 原始要求保留在 requested.config；原因逐项见 编译修复审计.md。
# 不构建 ImageBuilder，standalone 子选项无效。
# CONFIG_IB_STANDALONE is not set
# iStoreOS 专用内核动态加载、屏幕和国际版组件不冒充已移植。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_dkml is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_lcdsimple is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_istoreos-intl is not set
# 当前包源没有对应 recipe。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-fs-binfmt-misc is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_mergerfs is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-app-mergerfs is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-mergerfs-zh-cn is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-lib-mac-vendor is not set
# 独立翻译缺失或未选择主程序；H69K 风扇驱动仍保留。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-fan-zh-cn is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-filetransfer-zh-cn is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-oled-zh-cn is not set
# 未移植视频加速，隐藏 DMA helper 由真正使用它的驱动选择。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-video-dma-contig is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-video-dv-timings is not set
# 当前官方 shadow 不生成这些已移除的工具。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_shadow-expiry is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_shadow-groupmems is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_shadow-logoutd is not set
# 当前官方 NFS/libtirpc 构建关闭 GSS；普通 NFS 服务保留。
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_librpcsecgss is not set
